{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_25","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\chuanle song\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Microsoft\\\\WindowsApps\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-Content pipeline/analyses/AdaRES-J1-J2_negative_diagnosis_20260926-141100.md -Raw; Get-Content pipeline/analyses/AdaRES-H1-H4_native_diagnosis_20260925-*.md -Raw -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue; Get-Content AdaRES/ipdn/model_paper5/adares_b4_query_competition/ipdn.py | Select-Object -Skip 105 -First 62; Get-Content 'C:\\\\Users\\\\chuanle song\\\\.codex\\\\skills\\\\songcl_research_pipeline\\\\references\\\\formats.md' -TotalCount 225\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_25","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\chuanle song\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Microsoft\\\\WindowsApps\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-Content pipeline/analyses/AdaRES-J1-J2_negative_diagnosis_20260926-141100.md -Raw; Get-Content pipeline/analyses/AdaRES-H1-H4_native_diagnosis_20260925-*.md -Raw -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue; Get-Content AdaRES/ipdn/model_paper5/adares_b4_query_competition/ipdn.py | Select-Object -Skip 105 -First 62; Get-Content 'C:\\\\Users\\\\chuanle song\\\\.codex\\\\skills\\\\songcl_research_pipeline\\\\references\\\\formats.md' -TotalCount 225\"","aggregated_output":"# Independent fixed-subset screens after H5\n\n2026-09-26 14:11 Asia/Shanghai. B4-E30 best checkpoint, fixed first 16 ScanRefer validation scenes, 441 expressions. Read-only native GPU1 inference, no training or selection-policy changes. Raw paired rows: `AdaRES-J1-J2_native_16scenes_20260926.json`; script: `AdaRES/tools/diagnose_adares_j1_mask_language_evidence.py`.\n\n| Route | Predeclared mechanism | Observation on 240 material selection errors | Disposition |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| J1 | Target mask foreground-minus-background scene features better match the projected language summary than a wrongly selected mask | Oracle contrast higher in 123/240. Contrast-only top-1 subset mIoU 0.01315 versus B4 0.49186; a scene-only control reached 0.00119. | Reject this pooled-language contrast route; no validation feature or weight scan. |\n| J2 | Overlap-crowded oracle masks are suppressed by B4's rival context | Oracle crowding higher in only 78/240; mean oracle crowding 6.487 versus selected 7.936. | Reject duplicate-mask suppression mechanism as stated. |\n\nThe J1 pooled text summary is a diagnostic proxy, not a trained cross-attention control. A poor standalone ranker does not refute every learned mask-language mechanism, but the paired error contrast fails this route's proposed direction. J2 uses B4's own soft overlap definition without a new threshold. Both are bounded observational tests and not full-validation effects. Neither passes the diagnosis gate; controls, native backward, candidate-specific resources, independence and admission receipt are not claimed. GPU1 remains vacant rather than filling it with a placeholder.\n\r\n\r\n    def forward(self, batch, mode='loss'):\r\n        if mode == 'loss':\r\n            return self.loss(**batch)\r\n        elif mode == 'predict':\r\n            return self.predict(**batch)\r\n\r\n    @cuda_cast\r\n    def loss(self, ann_ids, scan_ids, voxel_coords, p2v_map, v2p_map, spatial_shape, feats, superpoints, batch_offsets, object_idss, gt_pmasks, gt_spmasks, sp_ref_masks, lang_tokenss, lang_masks, coords_float, sp_ins_labels, dense_maps, scenes_len=None, meta_datas=None, view_dependents=None, feats_2d=None):\r\n        batch_size = len(batch_offsets) - 1\r\n        voxel_feats = pointgroup_ops.voxelization(feats, v2p_map)\r\n        input = spconv.SparseConvTensor(voxel_feats, voxel_coords.int(), spatial_shape, batch_size)\r\n\r\n        sp_feats = self.extract_feat(input, superpoints, p2v_map)\r\n        sp_coords_float = scatter_mean(coords_float, superpoints, dim=0)\r\n\r\n        sp_feats, sp_coords_float, fps_seed_sp, batch_offsets, sp_ins_labels, feats_2d = self.expand_and_fps(sp_feats, sp_coords_float, batch_offsets, sp_ins_labels, scenes_len, feats_2d, mode='tr')\r\n        lang_feats = self.text_encoder(lang_tokenss, attention_mask=lang_masks)[0]\r\n\r\n        out = self.dec(sp_feats, fps_seed_sp, batch_offsets, lang_feats, lang_masks, sp_coords_float, feats_2d)\r\n        \r\n        loss, loss_dict = self.criterion(out, gt_spmasks, sp_ref_masks, object_idss, sp_ins_labels, dense_maps, lang_masks, fps_seed_sp, sp_coords_float, batch_offsets)\r\n\r\n        return loss, loss_dict\r\n    \r\n    @cuda_cast\r\n    def predict(self, ann_ids, scan_ids, voxel_coords, p2v_map, v2p_map, spatial_shape, feats, superpoints, batch_offsets, object_idss, gt_pmasks, gt_spmasks, sp_ref_masks, lang_tokenss, lang_masks, coords_float, sp_ins_labels, dense_maps, scenes_len=None, meta_datas=None, view_dependents=None, feats_2d=None):\r\n        batch_size = len(batch_offsets) - 1\r\n        voxel_feats = pointgroup_ops.voxelization(feats, v2p_map)\r\n        input = spconv.SparseConvTensor(voxel_feats, voxel_coords.int(), spatial_shape, batch_size)\r\n        \r\n        sp_feats = self.extract_feat(input, superpoints, p2v_map)\r\n        sp_coords_float = scatter_mean(coords_float, superpoints, dim=0)\r\n\r\n        sp_feats, sp_coords_float, fps_seed_sp, batch_offsets, sp_ins_labels, feats_2d = self.expand_and_fps(sp_feats, sp_coords_float, batch_offsets, sp_ins_labels, scenes_len, feats_2d, mode='pred')\r\n        lang_feats = self.text_encoder(lang_tokenss, attention_mask=lang_masks)[0]\r\n        \r\n        out = self.dec(sp_feats, fps_seed_sp, batch_offsets, lang_feats, lang_masks, sp_coords_float, feats_2d) \r\n        ret = self.predict_by_feat(scan_ids, object_idss, ann_ids, out, superpoints, gt_pmasks, gt_spmasks, fps_seed_sp)\r\n        if meta_datas[0] is not None: \r\n            ret['meta_datas'] = meta_datas\r\n            if view_dependents[0] is not None:\r\n                ret['view_dependents'] = view_dependents\r\n        return ret\r\n    \r\n    def predict_by_feat(self, scan_ids, object_idss, ann_ids, out, superpoints, gt_pmasks, gt_spmasks, fps_seed_sp):\r\n        # B is 1 when predecit\r\n        spious, pious, sp_r_ious, p_r_ious, pred_pmasks, scan_idss = [], [], [], [], [], []\r\n        seed_inds, sample_inds, indis = [], [], []\r\n        nt_labels = []\r\n        b = len(object_idss)\r\n        for i in range(b):\r\n            gt_pmask = gt_pmasks[i]\r\n            gt_spmask = gt_spmasks[i]\r\n            pred_spmask = out['masks'][i].squeeze()\r\n\r\n            pred_indis = out['indis'][i] # [n_q, 2]\r\n            # take the 1 \r\n            if self.task_type == 'gres':\r\n                indicate = pred_indis.argmax(-1) == 1\r\n                top = indicate.nonzero(as_tuple=False).squeeze(-1)\r\n                # nt_label\r\n# 文档模板汇总 — songcl_research_pipeline\r\n\r\n本文件是流水线全部产出文档的**唯一格式源**。生成任何 pipeline 文档前先读对应模板，禁止凭记忆自由发挥。\r\n\r\n| # | 模板 | 写入路径 | 生成时机 |\r\n|---|---|---|---|\r\n| 1 | [Tick 报告](#1-tick-报告) | `pipeline/reports/summary_<ts>.md` | 每次 cron tick / 用户前台询问（`_manual` 后缀） |\r\n| 2 | [终态结果分析](#2-终态结果分析) | `pipeline/analyses/<id>_<state>_<ts>.md` | 实验判定为终态后自动生成 |\r\n| 3 | [实验设计](#3-实验设计) | `pipeline/designs/exp_design_<ts>.md` | 自主/手动设计新一批实验时 |\r\n| 4 | [动机审查](#4-动机审查) | `pipeline/reviews/motivation_review_<ts>.md` | 每次自主设计前（exp_design 的上游） |\r\n| 5 | [消融方案](#5-消融方案) | `pipeline/designs/ablation_plan_<ts>.md` | PHASE1_REACHED 后出方案与用户讨论 |\r\n| 6 | [决策记录/索引](#6-决策记录与索引) | `pipeline/decisions/<ts>_<type>.md` + `_index.md` | 每次决策（log_decision.sh 自动写） |\r\n| 7 | [Crash 修复记录](#7-crash-修复记录) | `pipeline/bugfixes/bugfix_<ts>.md` | crash 自修复时 |\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## 1. Tick 报告\r\n\r\n每次 cron tick 的 `pipeline/reports/summary_<YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS>.md` 和**用户前台询问状态**时，使用以下固定格式。**始终使用完整六段格式（0-5），不允许精简、不允许合并为单行**。即使没有任何变化，也要展开完整的表格结构和段落标题。删 24h 前旧 summary。禁止自由发挥。\r\n\r\n```\r\n================================================================================\r\n  Research Pipeline Report — <project_name>\r\n  <YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS> (tick #<N>)\r\n================================================================================\r\n\r\n## 0. Goal Status\r\n  Target: mIoU ≥ X.XXXX | Champion: <id> X.XXXX | Gap: ±0.00XX | Phase: 1 (NOT YET) / 2 (ABLATION)\r\n  (从 pipeline/goal.json 读取，check_goal.py 结果。无 goal.json 时写 \"No goal defined.\")\r\n\r\n\r\n## 1. GPU Overview\r\n┌──────────┬──────┬───────┬─────────────┬──────────────────────────┐\r\n│ Server   │ GPU  │ Util  │ Memory      │ Process                  │\r\n├──────────┼──────┼───────┼─────────────┼──────────────────────────┤\r\n│ server-X │ 0    │ 95%   │ 18.6/24 GB  │ text_unet (pid 108985)   │\r\n│ server-X │ 1    │ 0%    │ 0.0/24 GB   │ — IDLE —                 │\r\n│ server-Y │ 0    │ 0%    │ 0.0/24 GB   │ — IDLE —                 │\r\n│ ...      │      │       │             │                          │\r\n└──────────┴──────┴───────┴─────────────┴──────────────────────────┘\r\nFree GPUs: server-X:1, server-Y:0\r\n(只列出本项目 SERVERS.yaml 中 role=gpu_server 且在 allowed_gpus 白名单内的服务器)\r\n\r\n## 2. Running Experiments\r\n| ID       | Config                        | Server   | GPU | Epoch    | Best mIoU | Acc@50 | spmIOU | No-Impr | Status     |\r\n|----------|-------------------------------|----------|-----|----------|-----------|--------|--------|----------|------------|\r\n| dec4     | model_early_exit_4_dec4       | server-2 | 1   | 29/50    | 0.4874    | 0.542  | 0.449  | 4/10     | running    |\r\n| text_unet| model_early_exit_4_text_unet  | server-3 | 0   | 21/50    | 0.4986    | 0.551  | 0.458  | 1/10     | running    |\r\n| ...      |                               |          |     |          |           |        |        |          |            |\r\n\r\n## 3. Queue Status\r\n| Position | ID   | Config                           | Status  | Depends On    | Server     |\r\n|----------|------|----------------------------------|---------|---------------|------------|\r\n| 1        | XXX  | ...                              | waiting | —             | server-X   |\r\n| 2        | YYY  | ...                              | waiting | XXX           | server-X   |\r\n| ...      |      |                                  |         |               |            |\r\nActive capacity: A active (R running, C claiming, W waiting) / N target → capacity OK / NEED MORE；candidate budget = B\r\n\r\n## 4. This Tick's Actions\r\n  - [自主早停] <action> — <result>\r\n  - [队列推送] <action> — <result>\r\n  - [代码同步] <action> — <result>\r\n  - [终态判定] <action> — <result>\r\n  - [实验设计] <action> — <result>\r\n  (无动作时写 \"No actions taken. All stable.\")\r\n\r\n## 5. Decisions Made\r\n  - [YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM] <type>: <decision> (见 pipeline/decisions/_index.md)\r\n  (无决策时写 \"No decisions this tick.\")\r\n\r\n================================================================================\r\n  Next tick: <YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM>\r\n================================================================================\r\n```\r\n\r\n**格式强制检查**:\r\n- 第 0 段: Goal Status — 每次必写。无 goal.json 写 \"No goal defined.\"，有则显示 target/champion/gap/phase\r\n- 第 1 段: GPU Overview — 只列白名单内的服务器和卡\r\n- 第 2 段: Running Experiments — 必须含 10 列(ID/Config/Server/GPU/Epoch/Best-mIoU/Acc50/spmIOU/No-Impr/Status)\r\n- 第 3 段: Queue Status — 队列顺序 + 深度判定\r\n- 第 4 段: This Tick's Actions — 每次必写，无动作也说\"No actions\"\r\n- 第 5 段: Decisions Made — 每次必写，无决策也说\"No decisions\"\r\n- **禁止精简格式**：不允许 `## GPU: server-4 GPU0(...), GPU1(...)` 这类单行合并。即使无变化，每个段落标题必须独立出现，GPU/Running 表格必须完整展开。\r\n- 结尾: Next tick 时间\r\n\r\n**用户前台询问**: 用户说\"查看 pipeline 状态\"/\"实验进度\"/\"pipeline 报告\"等:\r\n- 按六段固定格式现场输出\r\n- **必须同步写入** `pipeline/reports/summary_<YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS>_manual.md`。使用 bash `cat > file << 'EOF' ... EOF` 写入，内容即上述六段格式的完整输出。不要跳过这一步。\r\n- `_manual` 后缀区分 cron 触发 vs 手动查询，方便事后追溯\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## 2. 终态结果分析\r\n\r\n每个实验判定为终态后，**cron tick 必须自动生成该文件**。后续实验设计的 Phase 1 分析主要读取这组文件。\r\n\r\n```\r\n================================================================================\r\n  Experiment Result Analysis — <project_name>\r\n  Experiment: <experiment_id> | State: <state>\r\n================================================================================\r\n\r\n## 1. Basic Info\r\n  - ID: <id>\r\n  - Config: <config_path>\r\n  - Server: <server> | GPU: <gpu_id>\r\n  - Started: <start_time> | Finished: <end_time> | Duration: <Xs/h>\r\n  - State: done_complete | done_earlystop | crashed\r\n\r\n## 2. Best Metrics\r\n  | Metric   | Value  | @ Epoch |\r\n  |----------|--------|---------|\r\n  | mIoU     | X.XXXX | N       |\r\n  | Acc@50   | X.XXX  | N       |\r\n  | spmIOU   | X.XXXX | N       |\r\n  (if crashed: last saved mIoU before crash)\r\n\r\n## 3. Convergence Summary\r\n  - Best first reached at: epoch <N>\r\n  - Subsequent no_improve epochs: <K> (if early-stopped)\r\n  - Final epoch best: mIoU=X.XXXX vs historical best=X.XXXX\r\n  - (简要描述收敛形态: 快速上升后平台/震荡/一直未收敛)\r\n\r\n## 4. Comparison\r\n  - vs baseline (<baseline_id>): γ = +0.00XX (有效) / -0.00XX (失败) / ≈0 (持平)\r\n  - vs current champion (<champion_id>): γ = ±0.00XX\r\n  - (列出所有可对比的前置实验)\r\n\r\n## 5. Conclusion\r\n  - 结论: [有效] / [失败] / [持平]\r\n  - 解释: <一句话说清这个实验证明了什么>\r\n  - 对后续实验设计的建议: <复现验证? 扩展该方向? 放弃?>\r\n\r\n## 6. Crash Info (if crashed)\r\n  - Error type: <import / CUDA OOM / dimension mismatch / ...>\r\n  - Error message excerpt: <first 5 lines>\r\n  - Auto-fix attempt: <Y/N> — <retries> retries, result: <fixed/abandoned>\r\n================================================================================\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## 3. 实验设计\r\n\r\n`pipeline/designs/exp_design_<ts>.md`，7 段格式：\r\n\r\n```\r\n================================================================================\r\n  Experiment Design — <project_name>\r\n  <YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS>\r\n================================================================================\r\n\r\n## 1. Motivation（为什么设计这批实验）\r\n  - 项目动机（直接引用 goal.json description）: <goal.description>\r\n  - 故事线当前状态: 已验证的假设 / 未验证的假设 / 缺口\r\n  - 触发原因: running+claiming+waiting < target_active，candidate_budget=B / Phase 2 消融计划确认\r\n  - 这批变体在故事线中的角色: 验证假设X / 排除方向Y / 消融确认Z\r\n\r\n## 2. Current Best Results（基于什么数据做决策）\r\n| Experiment ID | Config                  | State          | Best mIoU | Acc@50 | spmIOU | Epochs |\r\n|---------------|-------------------------|----------------|-----------|--------|--------|--------|\r\n| ...           | ...                     | done_complete  | 0.5012    | 0.552  | 0.460  | 50     |\r\n| ...           | ...                     | done_earlystop | 0.4874    | 0.542  | 0.449  | 29     |\r\n  (来源: pipeline/analyses/ 下各实验终态分析 + experiments.csv + pipeline/decisions/_index.md)\r\n\r\n## 3. Analysis & Direction（方向分析）\r\n  ### 3.1 哪些方向有效（> baseline）\r\n    - <方向A>: best=X.XXXX, γ=+0.00XX vs baseline, 机制分析: ...\r\n  ### 3.2 哪些方向失败（< baseline 或持平）\r\n    - <方向B>: best=X.XXXX, γ=-0.00XX vs baseline, 失败原因推测: ...\r\n  ### 3.3 哪些尚未消融\r\n    - <方向C>: roadmap 计划但未跑, 优先级: high/medium/low\r\n  ### 3.4 结论\r\n    - 下一步选择理由（为什么这批设计比别的方向更值得投入）\r\n\r\n## 4. Experiment Plan（具体做什么）\r\n| # | ID            | Config Path            | Purpose / Hypothesis                          | Expected Result            | Priority | Depends On |\r\n|---|---------------|------------------------|-----------------------------------------------|----------------------------|----------|------------|\r\n| 1 | <id>          | configs/.../xxx.yaml   | <这个实验验证什么假设? 为什么预期> 0.50?       | > baseline 0.4956          | P0       | —          |\r\n| 2 | <id>          | configs/.../yyy.yaml   | <假设>                                         | > current best 0.5012      | P1       | <id1>      |\r\n| 3 | <id>          | configs/.../zzz.yaml   | <假设>                                         | complement evidence chain  | P2       | —          |\r\n\r\n## 5. GPU Allocation Plan（GPU 分配计划）\r\n| Server   | GPU | Assignment              | Config                       | Justification            |\r\n|----------|-----|-------------------------|------------------------------|--------------------------|\r\n| server-4 | 0   | 当前 running: l1_refine | ...                          | —                        |\r\n| server-4 | 1   | 当前 running: l1_detail | ...                          | —                        |\r\n| server-4 | 0   | Next: <id>              | configs/.../xxx.yaml         | first free card gets P0  |\r\n| server-4 | 1   | Next: <id>              | configs/.../yyy.yaml         | second card gets P1      |\r\n  空闲卡均为 FIFO 队列顺序分配，不绑定卡号(gpu 字段不写或写 None)\r\n\r\n## 6. Implementation Checklist（实施清单）\r\n  - [ ] 检查现有 config 是否可直接复用或仅需 YAML 参数变更\r\n  - [ ] 如需新 model 代码: <描述变更内容, 文件路径, 预计行数>\r\n  - [ ] 创建 config YAML: configs/<path>/<name>.yaml\r\n  - [ ] git add + commit + push\r\n  - [ ] **sync 到所有可用服务器**（见 SKILL.md「代码同步规则」）\r\n  - [ ] 更新 pipeline/queue.json (追加到 gpu_queues.server-X 队尾)\r\n  - [ ] 验证: 下次 cron tick 跑 pipeline_monitor 确认新任务正常启动\r\n\r\n## 7. Risk Assessment（风险评估）\r\n  - 代码风险: （是否涉及新 model 包 / 结构性改动 / CUDA 扩展?）\r\n  - 资源风险: （是否需要更多 GPU 显存? 是否影响其他项目?）\r\n  - 数据风险: （是否需要新数据集? 现有数据够不够?）\r\n  - 失败回退: （如果 crash 3 次，怎么处理? 跳回哪个方向?）\r\n================================================================================\r\n  Status: DRAFT | APPROVED | IMPLEMENTED\r\n  Designed by: Research Pipeline (autonomous)\r\n  Created: <YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM>\r\n================================================================================\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## 4. 动机审查\r\n\r\n`pipeline/reviews/motivation_review_<ts>.md`，6 段格式。是 exp_design 的**上游分析**，每次自主设计实验前必须生成。\r\n\r\n```\r\n================================================================================\r\n  Motivation Review — <project_name>\r\n  <YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS>\r\n================================================================================\r\n\r\n## 1. Goal\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
